Type: Package
Package: equatags
Title: Equations to 'XML'
Version: 0.3.0.005
Authors@R: c(
    person("David", "Gohel", , "david.gohel@ardata.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("ArData", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Provides function to transform latex math expressions into
    format 'HTML' or 'Office Open XML Math'. The 'XML' result can then be
    included in 'HTML', 'Microsoft Word' documents or 'Microsoft
    PowerPoint' presentations by using a 'Markdown' document or the R
    package 'officer'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
BugReports: https://github.com/ardata-fr/equatags/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: 
    katex,
    xml2,
    xslt
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
